# FVM Version Cache
.fvm/

# NOT *.g.dart / *.freezed.dart — this package is consumed by other apps as
# a git dependency, not built locally by them. build_runner only generates
# code for the package you're actively developing; a consumer fetching this
# via `git:` never runs codegen against it, so the generated files have to
# be committed here or every consumer's build breaks on missing part files.
# Regenerate with `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`
# after touching any @freezed/@JsonSerializable class, then commit the diff.

# Local-only override for shared package dev (see docs/SHARED_PACKAGE_DEV_GUIDE.md)
pubspec_overrides.yaml*
